    "html": "<div class=\"c-donate c-donate--monthly no-bottom-margin o-module\">\n<div class=\"o-layout-container\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__top\">\n<h2 class=\"c-donate__title\">You can change lives for the better</h2>\n<div class=\"c-donate__dropdown\">\n<span class=\"c-donate__choose-before\">I would like to make a </span>\n<select class=\"js-donate__choose c-donate__choose\">\n<option value=\"monthly\">monthly</option>\n<option value=\"one-off\">one-off</option>\n</select>\n<span class=\"c-donate__choose-after\">donation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__options-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__monthly c-donate__length c-donate__length--active\">\n<form action=\"https://donate.sightsavers.org/detect\" class=\"js-donate-form\" method=\"get\">\n<input name=\"gb_appeal\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"web2026uk\"/>\n<input name=\"global_appeal\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"web2026gl\"/>\n<div class=\"c-donate__cards o-flex\">\n<input class=\"c-donate__select c-donate__monthly-loop-1 c-donate__monthly-sel\" data-id=\"1\" id=\"monthly-amount-1-1254526293\" name=\"monthlyAmount\" type=\"radio\" value=\"4\">\n<label class=\"c-donate__card o-flex-item\" for=\"monthly-amount-1-1254526293\">\n<img alt=\"A girl smiles after a cataract operation.\" class=\"c-donate__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/khadijah-post-op-580x326.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"c-donate__card-bottom\">\n<span class=\"c-donate__amount c-donate-side__amount--£\">£4</span>\n<p>In a year, your donation could help pay for a cataract consumables kit for five operations.</p>\n</div>\n</label>\n<input checked=\"\" class=\"c-donate__select c-donate__monthly-loop-2 c-donate__monthly-sel\" data-id=\"2\" id=\"monthly-amount-2-1254526293\" name=\"monthlyAmount\" type=\"radio\" value=\"9\">\n<label class=\"c-donate__card c-donate__card--active o-flex-item\" for=\"monthly-amount-2-1254526293\">\n<img alt=\"Surgeons operate on a trachoma patient.\" class=\"c-donate__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Sightsavers-trachoma-surgery-580x326.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"c-donate__card-bottom\">\n<span class=\"c-donate__amount c-donate-side__amount--£\">£9</span>\n<p>In a year, your donation could help pay for a trichiasis operation to stop someone going blind.</p>\n</div>\n</label>\n<input class=\"c-donate__select c-donate__monthly-loop-3 c-donate__monthly-sel\" data-id=\"3\" id=\"monthly-amount-3-1254526293\" name=\"monthlyAmount\" type=\"radio\" value=\"12\">\n<label class=\"c-donate__card o-flex-item\" for=\"monthly-amount-3-1254526293\">\n<img alt=\"A man stands for a portrait outside.\" class=\"c-donate__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/portrait_of_Albino_Jomuoio_Mozambique-580x326.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"c-donate__card-bottom\">\n<span class=\"c-donate__amount c-donate-side__amount--£\">£12</span>\n<p>In a year, your donation could help protect 720 families from losing their sight to river blindness.</p>\n</div>\n</label>\n</input></input></input></div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__mobile-content\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__mobile-text c-donate__mobile-text--1\">\n<p>In a year, your donation could help pay for a cataract consumables kit for five operations.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__mobile-text c-donate__mobile-text--active c-donate__mobile-text--2\">\n<p>In a year, your donation could help pay for a trichiasis operation to stop someone going blind.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__mobile-text c-donate__mobile-text--3\">\n<p>In a year, your donation could help protect 720 families from losing their sight to river blindness.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<input name=\"Task\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Next\"/>\n<input name=\"Frequency\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"frqmonthly\"/>\n<input class=\"monthly-amount-other\" id=\"monthly-amount-other\" name=\"monthlyAmount\" type=\"radio\" value=\"other\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__form-bottom\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__custom-cont c-donate__form-bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__custom-wrapper\">\n<span class=\"c-donate__symbol c-donate__symbol--gb\">£</span>\n<label class=\"screen-reader\" for=\"custom-amount-donation-field-monthly--1254526293\">Enter custom donation amount, minimum  £ 2, maximum £ 10,000</label>\n<input class=\"c-donate__monthly-custom c-donate__custom\" id=\"custom-amount-donation-field-monthly--1254526293\" maxamount=\"10000\" maxlength=\"6\" minamount=\"2\" name=\"monthlyAmount_OtherAmt\" placeholder=\"Or enter your own amount here\" placeholdertext=\"Or enter your own amount here\" type=\"text\"/>\n<div class=\"c-donate__custom-error-min\">We're sorry, but the minimum donation we can take is £2</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__custom-error-max\">We're sorry, but we cannot process a donation of this size online. Please contact us on <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#10797e767f5063797778646371667562633e7f6277\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"ee87808881ae9d8789869a9d8f988b9c9dc0819c89\">[email protected]</span></a> for assistance donating over £10,000</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__form-payment-options c-donate__form-bottom-item\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__form-buttons c-donate__form-bottom-item\">\n<button <span=\"\" class=\"c-btn c-donate__btn--monthly c-btn--pay\" type=\"submit\">Donate £<span class=\"c-donate__monthly-btn-val\"></span> a month\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</input></form>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__single c-donate__length\">\n<form action=\"https://donate.sightsavers.org/detect\" class=\"js-donate-form\" method=\"get\">\n<input name=\"gb_appeal\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"web2026uk\"/>\n<input name=\"global_appeal\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"web2026gl\"/>\n<div class=\"c-donate__cards o-flex\">\n<input class=\"c-donate__select c-donate__single-loop-1 c-donate__single-sel\" data-id=\"1\" id=\"single-amount-1-1254526293\" name=\"singleAmount\" type=\"radio\" value=\"30\">\n<label class=\"c-donate__card o-flex-item\" for=\"single-amount-1-1254526293\">\n<img alt=\"A woman receives medication to treat river blindness from community volunteer.\" class=\"c-donate__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/2111_Mali_river-blindness-mass-drug-administration_01-580x326.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"c-donate__card-bottom\">\n<span class=\"c-donate__amount c-donate-side__amount--£\">£30</span>\n<p>Your donation could help protect 150 families from losing their sight to river blindness.</p>\n</div>\n</label>\n<input checked=\"\" class=\"c-donate__select c-donate__single-loop-2 c-donate__single-sel\" data-id=\"2\" id=\"single-amount-2-1254526293\" name=\"singleAmount\" type=\"radio\" value=\"66\">\n<label class=\"c-donate__card c-donate__card--active o-flex-item\" for=\"single-amount-2-1254526293\">\n<img alt=\"Surgical staff perform a cataract operation.\" class=\"c-donate__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/Sightsavers-cataract-operation-Bangladesh-580x326.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"c-donate__card-bottom\">\n<span class=\"c-donate__amount c-donate-side__amount--£\">£66</span>\n<p>Your donation could help pay for cataract operations to give sight to two adults.</p>\n</div>\n</label>\n<input class=\"c-donate__select c-donate__single-loop-3 c-donate__single-sel\" data-id=\"3\" id=\"single-amount-3-1254526293\" name=\"singleAmount\" type=\"radio\" value=\"94\">\n<label class=\"c-donate__card o-flex-item\" for=\"single-amount-3-1254526293\">\n<img alt=\"Asha smiles outside her home following her cataract operation.\" class=\"c-donate__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/Sightsavers-Asha-cataracts-donation-1-580x326.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"c-donate__card-bottom\">\n<span class=\"c-donate__amount c-donate-side__amount--£\">£94</span>\n<p>Your donation could help pay for a sight-restoring cataract operation for a child.</p>\n</div>\n</label>\n</input></input></input></div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__mobile-content\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__mobile-text c-donate__mobile-text--1\">\n<p>Your donation could help protect 150 families from losing their sight to river blindness.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__mobile-text c-donate__mobile-text--active c-donate__mobile-text--2\">\n<p>Your donation could help pay for cataract operations to give sight to two adults.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__mobile-text c-donate__mobile-text--3\">\n<p>Your donation could help pay for a sight-restoring cataract operation for a child.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<input name=\"Task\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Next\"/>\n<input name=\"Frequency\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"frqsingle\"/>\n<input class=\"single-amount-other\" id=\"single-amount-other\" name=\"singleAmount\" type=\"radio\" value=\"other\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__form-bottom\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__custom-cont c-donate__form-bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__custom-wrapper\">\n<span class=\"c-donate__symbol c-donate__symbol--gb\">£</span>\n<label class=\"screen-reader\" for=\"custom-amount-donation-field-single--1254526293\">Enter custom donation amount, minimum  £ 2, maximum £ 10,000</label>\n<input class=\"c-donate__single-custom c-donate__custom\" id=\"custom-amount-donation-field-single--1254526293\" maxamount=\"10000\" maxlength=\"6\" minamount=\"2\" name=\"singleAmount_OtherAmt\" placeholder=\"Or enter your own amount here\" placeholdertext=\"Or enter your own amount here\" type=\"text\"/>\n<div class=\"c-donate__custom-error-min\">We're sorry, but the minimum donation we can take is £2</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__custom-error-max\">We're sorry, but we cannot process a donation of this size online. Please contact us on <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#92fbfcf4fdd2e1fbf5fae6e1f3e4f7e0e1bcfde0f5\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"bbd2d5ddd4fbc8d2dcd3cfc8dacddec9c895d4c9dc\">[email protected]</span></a> for assistance donating over £10,000</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__form-payment-options c-donate__form-bottom-item\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__form-buttons c-donate__form-bottom-item\">\n<button <span=\"\" class=\"c-btn c-donate__btn--single c-btn--pay\" type=\"submit\">Donate £<span class=\"c-donate__single-btn-val\"></span> now\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</input></form>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "tag": "div",
    "classes": [
      "c-icon-block",
