    "style": "",
    "html": "<div class=\"c-icon-block o-module c-ip-block--grey no-bottom-margin\">\n<div class=\"o-layout-container\">\n<h2 class=\"c-icon-block__title\"><strong>Other ways to give</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"c-icon-block__scroll-overlay\">\n<div class=\"c-icon-block__scroll-wrap\">\n<div class=\"c-icon-block__content\" data-mobile-scroll-inner=\"\">\n<div class=\"c-icon-card o-grid__m-1 o-grid__t-2 o-grid__d-2\" data-mobile-scroll-card=\"\">\n<img alt=\"Angelyn and her grandmother, link arms and smile, with dusty ground and trees in the background.\" class=\"c-icon-card__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/2107_Angelyn-and-her-grandmother-smile-in-Bong-County-580x326.jpg\"/>\n<h3 class=\"c-icon-block__heading\">Give in memory</h3>\n<p>By asking loved ones to make a donation to charity when someone passes away, you can change the future for generations of people in low-income countries.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-icon-card o-grid__m-1 o-grid__t-2 o-grid__d-2\" data-mobile-scroll-card=\"\">\n<img alt=\"A girl smiles as she has her eyes checked during a vision screening in Libera.\" class=\"c-icon-card__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/1907_Faith-has-her-eyes-checked-in-Liberia-580x326.jpg\"/>\n<h3 class=\"c-icon-block__heading\">Gift aid</h3>\n<p>If you’re a UK taxpayer, any donation you give will be worth 25 per cent more, at no extra cost to you. This means your donation of £60 could be worth an extra £15.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-icon-block__footer\">\n<a class=\"c-btn c-icon-block__button\" href=\"/contact-us/\">\n\t\t\t\t\tTo learn about other ways to give, contact us\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
  }
]